WEBVTT

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.380
I'm just after the reward.

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:51.200
Nothing personal.

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:55.140
Bring it!

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:17.290
Running away?

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.800
There might be a den.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:20.520
Go.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:21.630
Let's go, Pete!

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.650
No matter what it takes, we have to hold them back!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:52.270
Rodorino, is Alita still not here?

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:53.260
She'll be here soon.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.700
Your Majesty! You're hurt!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.610
Listen, Alita.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:25.080
The rebels will attack this place soon.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.310
We must treat you quickly.

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:29.150
You must escape.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.700
If only my brother was here...

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:39.000
It's fortuitous that there are no other heirs in this castle.

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.500
If you remain alive,

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.540
the Forland family will endure.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:52.570
Go through the Ellend Forest, and head towards the border.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:54.890
Alita...

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.840
live on!

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.830
Your Majesty!

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:11.840
Your Majesty...

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:15.570
We will accompany you. Let us hurry.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.160
Princess, please...

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.850
Jodo, please take care of everyone.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:42.540
Mirano!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.880
Please stay safe, Princess Alita.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:47.730
No...

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:51.590
It is this handmaid's honor to do this for you.

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.740
Princess, you must hurry.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:05:59.550
I'm sorry.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:12.150
Let's go.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:46.400
Children... young girls.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.560
What strength.

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:52.810
Where is Princess Alita?

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.730
Rocket Punch!

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:02.970
What?! They have artificial arms?

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.200
He's dead.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:12.070
That girl... she's an artificial doll.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:21.270
But, In this country, the technology required to create those is safely guarded.

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:26.310
The only people who have access to those secrets are this country's royal scholars.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:27.970
It can't be!

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.250
Doctor Akamashi!

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:38.690
You bastard, are you going against the family that so generously educated you?

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.670
You traitor!

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:46.830
It's over.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:52.880
Lord Rodorino!

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:05.910
Listen up! The doctor says this is not a rebellion.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.300
It's a coup. A coup d'état!

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:12.990
Cease your resistance and deliver Princess Alita to us.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:16.310
The doctor also says,

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:20.900
"If you do not obey, you will all die." Got it?

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:24.920
Everyone in this room will die!

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:36.210
So, what's your answer?

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.710
Then I will kill you all.

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.600
It's begun.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:59.130
What is the Princess up to?

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.940
She's taken the secret path through Ellend Forest.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:05.000
I see.

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:07.530
Let's go.

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:14.470
I... I need to rest for a moment.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:18.630
Princess, we have to get through this forest quickly.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.780
T-This is...

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.350
Help me... somebody...

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.370
Help me!

00:09:58.910 --> 00:09:59.870
Someone...

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:18.890
Who the hell are you?

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.160
Help...

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.020
Help me!

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:29.150
Calm down. I'm not going to hurt you.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.030
What the hell is it this time?

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:44.420
What the?!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.790
They got away.

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:25.780
Can't be helped I guess. Let's get back to the Mistress.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.050
What is it?

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:37.460
Y-You okay?

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:40.810
No, I'm not! Hey, isn't this the Mistress?

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:49.000
She's awake. The princess is awake.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.970
What... I...

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.020
I'M DEAD!!!!!!!!!

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:07.700
How can I be this pathetic?!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.240
What a stupid way to go. Dammit!

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:14.220
Suddenly diving off a cliff with the Princess...

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:20.450
Huh? Aren't these threads the Princess'?

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.900
How... and... why?

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:35.550
Tell me what just happened, Dominikov!

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:40.590
Why am I dead? Did I turn into the Princess? Did the Princess turn into me?

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:43.490
The Princess isn't dead, is she? Huh? Does that mean I'm dead?

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.910
Then what the hell am I?

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.120
What's going on, Dominikov?

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:49.160
I'm the one who wants to ask that.

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:55.740
Anyway, are you really Mistress Faris?

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:58.930
Why did the two of you fall out of the sky?

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:03.810
Well, about that... the Princess suddenly came out of the forest.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:08.330
It was a good thing I was able to stop myself from killing her back there.

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.900
But... oh shit.

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:15.400
It's come out of the forest?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.460
Thought so.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:27.230
The guardian of Ellend Forest, Jitterbug. Top quality stuff.

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:31.060
Oh yeah, if we kill it, we can get a bounty!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.460
Uh... I don't have my sword.

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:37.540
Wait, wait, wait!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:40.200
This isn't my body right now!

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.890
No! A monster!

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.280
Hey, bitch! Toss Himetsuru over here.

00:13:57.590 --> 00:13:59.050
Hime... tsuru?

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:01.770
Didn't you hear me?

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.760
Himetsuru. Hi-me-tsu-ru.

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:05.910
Be quick about it!

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:10.120
Why... am I over there?

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:17.660
The sword you're wearing around your waist, bitch!

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.200
Draw it and throw it over!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:19.220
Uh, ok!
Draw it and throw it over!

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:20.580
Uh, ok!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:42.650
It's like... I'm watching myself fight inside a dream.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.340
At that time, I thought...

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:54.870
I was fighting with such deep, intense emotion.

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:05.330
Are you saying that Mistress Faris' and my souls exchanged bodies?

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.290
Seems that way...

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:10.310
What is it called... the Law of Transmigration?

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:11.860
The Law of Spirits.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:20.190
When two people are facing death simultaneously, they say that their souls will change places.

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:25.870
So, when we fell off the cliff and faced death at the same time...

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:30.370
...we swapped souls? Is that it?

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:32.780
In simple terms, that's it.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:38.190
If it's something Dominikov says, I don't know whether it's true or not.

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:39.920
Then don't bother asking me!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:50.340
Please accept my humble apologies! All of this is my fault.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:54.700
I am the Princess of the Forland family, ruling over these lands.

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.900
Alita Forland.

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:01.000
A real princess?

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:03.440
I have been exceedingly rude,

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:07.410
and caused you so much trouble, but I must humbly ask one request of you.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:11.890
A rebellion has just broken out in my country.

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:15.920
The rebels have killed the King.

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:18.820
We have lost all hope.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:22.820
Only I was able to escape.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:30.100
Please! I beg you all to use your power to save our country!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:41.950
I refuse.

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:45.420
I'm a bounty hunter.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:49.510
I just hunt down these monsters for the reward money.

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:54.050
I'm not going to fight when there's no reward.

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:56.130
As an expression of my gratitude, I'll do anything.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:17:00.110
If we return to my country, I can give you money or anything else!

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:04.840
If there's no guarantee, why should I help you?

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:09.390
But, there's nothing else I can give you right now.

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:11.310
Then just give it up.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:13.860
I have to make a living too.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:16.050
though that's probably something that someone

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.710
with your sheltered upbringing wouldn't understand.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:20.450
Why...

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:30.050
In that case, please take me as the reward.

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:35.330
To protect my country, I don't care what I have to do.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:40.760
So, will that be enough?

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.220
I will decide what to do with that body afterward.

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:50.870
Then...

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:54.310
Take me to the castle!

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:55.640
Okay!

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:02.840
Could you kill Jitterbug?

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:04.170
I don't know.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.530
Hmm, how modest of you.

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:11.570
Anyway, the Princess certainly got her hands on some powerful allies.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:13.610
This will be fun.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:31.890
Princess Alita, you will come with us.

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:38.120
Ana-chan, the doctor says that girl is the Princess' attendant.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:42.170
Heh, a fake to gain time.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.680
I see it.

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:52.180
There it is.

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:52.200
Dominikov, jump over the moat!
There it is.

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:54.430
Dominikov, jump over the moat!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:56.910
I should be able to do it!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.410
Go!

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:15.720
Damn, are you pretending to be a biker?

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.670
We're going to die! We're all gonna die!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.980
Drive safely.

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:27.550
What's that?

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:32.030
That is...

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:36.530
Princess Alita.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.440
So that's the real one.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.270
P-Princess...

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:43.540
To go through all this trouble, and then come back. What an idiot!

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:49.280
That's my throne. Move, onion-head.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.160
How dare you insult the doctor's hairstyle as soon as you arrive!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.590
An onion-head is an onion-head.

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:05.150
Mistress! That king there has even worse taste than we thought.

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:07.900
Bad taste suits me fine.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.980
Come on and die.

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:32.950
Amazing.

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.610
What's going on?

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:44.750
Is that... Princess Alita?

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:49.130
Who the hell... is that woman?

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.740
So much for your big mouth. Is it over already?

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:58.470
Conceited, aren't we? I'll finish you off with a single blow!

00:20:58.640 --> 00:21:01.480
Princess, please run! She's going to...

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:07.860
Come!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.360
DIE!

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:19.910
Too slow.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:29.630
Shit! My body is...

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:33.150
You bitch, get over here and fight me!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.740
Ana-chan, are you alright?

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:40.740
Wait! Get back here!

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:45.750
Didn't I tell you? That's my seat.

00:21:46.890 --> 00:21:49.520
You can't be the Princess.

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.250
Who the hell are you?

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.630
Can't you tell by looking at me?

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:08.400
My father is dead, and I have come to take the throne!

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.090
I am Princess Alita Forland!

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:26.670
Thus, the strongest Princess in the annals of history was born.

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:35.630
With her fighting style, she became known as the "Murder Princess."
